    "updated_at": "2015-07-06T01:00:34Z",
    "body": "Ahh... ok. When it comes to removing something from a stack, I always assume it starts from the top of the stack, hence that step was interpreted as poping out elements until only the last one left.\n\nProbably clearer to say something like \"Unfullscreen all elements except the current top element\".\n",
